  "name": "Atriumline Contact",
  "description": "A company contact page for a business with offices around the world: topic cards that open the right form, your sales line and hours with an “Open now” line, and a grid of office cards — photo, address, phone, hours and a map link each.",
  "modelledOn": "A CRM company’s global contact page",
  "features": [
    "Topic cards (sales, support, partners, press), each asking its own questions",
    "Six offices as photo cards, each with its own hours and “Open now” on that office’s clock",
    "Sales line, languages and a structured schedule as fact tiles",
    "Other ways to get help — your docs, community and status spaces — found automatically",
    "Zero custom CSS — every detail is a theme setting"
  ],
