              "markdown": "Whatever you need, there is a team for it — and an office in your time zone. Choose a topic and the form asks only what that team needs to help you.\n\n## When you will hear back\n\nSales and partnership enquiries get a reply within one business day from the office nearest you. Support messages from paying customers are answered around the clock; everyone else hears back within one business day.\n\n## What to tell us\n\n- The name of your company and roughly how big your team is.\n- What you are trying to get done, in a sentence or two.\n- For support: the email on your account, and what happened instead of what you expected."
